      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like a conscience. it feels like i'm just hollow. like i'm a mistake. a person who's supposed to care but doesn't. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who shouldn't even be taking up space. like i'm just wasting oxygen that someone actually good could use.",
